go\u2019s purchase of Wachovia reported.  \n\n(Studio: Brian Williams) Stock Market Report. ", "segment_duration": 230, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 919972, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "p3MZS5K0Xg", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 919971, "segment_id": "0N9DbZglJl", "segment_broadcast_id": "p3MZS5K0Xg", "segment_title": "Economy: Jobs", "segment_description": "(Studio: Brian Williams) Figures on jobs lost cited.  \n\n(Miami: Mark Potter) Increasing unemployment featured; details given of industries that laid off workers and of the situation in Florida. [Unemployed Jim and Linda MALINOSKI&#134;&#134;- react to the collapse of their home construction business.] [Mesirow Financial Diane SWONK&#134;- predicts unemployment will continue to rise.] [Unemployed bartender Kelly LOWE&#134;- says there are no jobs to get.] [Food stamps counselor Leeann GODWIN&#134;- says it\u2019s hard for people to do this.] ", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63280.0", "legacy_segment_id": 919973, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "p3MZS5K0Xg", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1700, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 919971, "